's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"0b3a9c021f9868aa645319cb51a7679f","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"7348961f8ae94bbcede0decd6da018d1","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e8937ada44318d261b0d03c7d85b283e","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"99adb31cedcd597638d47441c9bafab4","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"9a7df71e87e52045457236bfda63951e","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"d3ff0ab917300ae117ffe304454ccf46","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"458215c991d0c2c64d8ff1917f175e31","originalFileName":"00688946-db1b-417d-b5c0-66cbad1a4661-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"3e7933d7